## Hints

- E1(c): the hinge at g = 0.02 — below it the fee is flat, above it the
  slope becomes 0.22.
- E2(b): size-matching ignores *co-movement*; the slope that matters is the
  covariance-based one (beta — day 11 measures it properly).
